{
  "title": "Quick Middle Eastern Dill Pickle Skewers",
  "description": "A spicy and snappy quick-fix Middle Eastern dish featuring dill pickles, infused oil, and served in agave leaves, suitable for a satvik friendly diet. This dish is perfect for a snack or light meal.",
  "cuisine": "Middle Eastern",
  "diet": [
